": \"s4\", \"text\": \"The evidence of Nõmme Kalju FC's participation in the Meistriliiga league is multifaceted and far-reaching.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"One need not look further than the club's impressive record in the league.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"Since its promotion to the top division in 2008, Nõmme Kalju FC has consistently finished in the top four, with a highest finish of second place in 2011.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"This level of consistency is a testament to the club's dedication to excellence and its commitment to competing at the highest level.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"Furthermore, the Estonian Football Association's (EJL) official records confirm Nõmme Kalju FC's participation in the Meistriliiga.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"The EJL, the governing body of football in Estonia, has meticulously documented the club's performances, including its match results, player statistics, and team standings.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"These records serve as irrefutable evidence of Nõmme Kalju FC's involvement in the league.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"In addition, the club's own website and social media channels provide a wealth of information about its Meistriliiga campaign.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"From match previews and reviews to player interviews and behind-the-scenes footage, Nõmme Kalju FC's online presence is a treasure trove of evidence that supports its participation in the league.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"The club's stadium, the Hiiu Stadium, is another piece of evidence that underscores its connection to the Meistriliiga.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"With a seating capacity of over 650, the stadium has played host to numerous Meistriliiga matches, including high-stakes encounters against rival clubs.\"}]}"
